{"n": 5637, "src": "Svíčka hoří už celé hodiny, takže tahle loužička na stole musí být roztavený vosk.", "en": "The candle has burned for hours, so this puddle on the table must be melted wax.", "lk_supplied": "must", "topic": "Modal verbs Probability", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5638, "src": "Prostorná pohovka, kterou chtěl jen pro sebe, byla úplně obsazena!", "en": "The spacious sofa which he wanted for himself was completely invaded!", "lk_supplied": "which", "topic": "Relative clauses", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5639, "src": "On seděl sám na prostorné pohovce minutu, než vběhli kamarádi.", "en": "He had been sitting alone on the spacious sofa for a minute before his friends ran in.", "lk_supplied": "had been sitting", "topic": "All Past Tenses", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5640, "src": "Včera večer on ťukl svou vysokou sklenicí o mou.", "en": "Last night he knocked his tall glass against mine.", "lk_supplied": "knocked", "topic": "Past Simple", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5641, "src": "V poledne už ona bude chodit po šatně v županu dvě hodiny.", "en": "By noon, she will have been walking around the dressing room in her robe for two hours.", "lk_supplied": "will have been walking", "topic": "Future Perfect Continuous", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5642, "src": "On může postavit plot za jeden den.", "en": "He can build a fence in one day.", "lk_supplied": "can", "topic": "Modal verb CAN", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5643, "src": "On postavil celý ten plot za jeden den, kámo. Dost ikonické.", "en": "He built that whole fence in one day, bro. Kinda iconic.", "lk_supplied": "built", "topic": "Past Simple", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5644, "src": "Malá loďka byla převeslována přes rybníček dívkou se štěnětem.", "en": "The little boat was rowed across the pond by a girl with a puppy.", "lk_supplied": "was rowed", "topic": "Passive", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5645, "src": "Proces byl pozorován, když kuchař odřezával tenké plátky vepřového na plotnu.", "en": "The process was observed while the cook was shaving thin slices of pork onto the griddle.", "lk_supplied": "was shaving", "topic": "Past Simple or Continuos", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5646, "src": "Kdyby kuchař nepřidal salsu, vepřové tacos by nevypadaly tak dobře.", "en": "If the cook hadn't added salsa, the pork tacos wouldn't have looked so good.", "lk_supplied": "wouldn't have looked", "topic": "3. Conditional", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5647, "src": "Řekla, že róba byla na úzkou chodbu příliš dlouhá.", "en": "She said that the gown was too long for the narrow corridor.", "lk_supplied": "was", "topic": "Reported speech", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5648, "src": "Holka, prý právě teď stojí v té zlaté róbě na jevišti.", "en": "Girl, apparently she is standing in that gold gown on stage right now.", "lk_supplied": "is standing", "topic": "All Present Tenses", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5649, "src": "Tohle rande museli naplánovat předem, protože balónek ve tvaru srdce už čekal.", "en": "They must have planned this date in advance, because the heart balloon was already waiting.", "lk_supplied": "must have", "topic": "Modals in past", "level": "B2", "person": "3pl", "number": "pl", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5650, "src": "Hádej co, slyšela jsem, že posádka zrovna míjela vrby, když jeden veslař vymrštil pěst do vzduchu.", "en": "Guess what, I heard the crew was passing the willows when a rower punched a fist up.", "lk_supplied": "punched", "topic": "Past Simple or Continuos", "level": "B1", "person": "1sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5651, "src": "Posádka držela dokonalý rytmus navzdory cyklistovi, který projížděl po stezce u řeky.", "en": "The crew kept perfect time despite the cyclist passing on the towpath.", "lk_supplied": "despite", "topic": "Advanced linkers", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5652, "src": "Kdyby vesničané neprojevili takovou spolupráci, konstrukce by ležela teď pořád na trávě.", "en": "If the villagers hadn't shown such cooperation, the frame would be still on the grass now.", "lk_supplied": "would be", "topic": "Mixed Conditional", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5653, "src": "Most se během honičky zlomil, takže prkna musela být hodně stará.", "en": "The bridge broke during the chase, so the planks must have been very old.", "lk_supplied": "must have been", "topic": "Modals in past", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5654, "src": "Ten ohnutý drátek musí být sponka — nic jiného sem nesedí.", "en": "That little bend of wire must be a paperclip — nothing else fits.", "lk_supplied": "must", "topic": "Modal verbs Probability", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5655, "src": "Kéž by si byl před deseti minutami dal sponku na vlastní hromadu.", "en": "He wishes he had put a clip on his own pile ten minutes ago.", "lk_supplied": "had put", "topic": "Wish clauses", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5656, "src": "On se směje u toho samého šíleně vtipného videa už deset minut.", "en": "He has been laughing at the same hilarious video for ten minutes.", "lk_supplied": "has been laughing", "topic": "Present Perfect Continuous", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5657, "src": "Kéž by se to šíleně vtipné video bylo nikdy neobjevilo na přednášce! Totální chaos!", "en": "I wish that hilarious video had never appeared in the lecture! Total chaos!", "lk_supplied": "had", "topic": "Wish clauses", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5658, "src": "Kámo, lilo jako z konve, když ten cizí člověk projevil starému pánovi opravdovou laskavost, fakt.", "en": "Bro, it was pouring when that stranger showed the old man some real kindness, no cap.", "lk_supplied": "was pouring", "topic": "Past Continuous", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5659, "src": "Laskavost cizího člověka se žlutým deštníkem vykouzlila starému pánovi úsměv.", "en": "The kindness of the stranger with the yellow umbrella made the old man smile.", "lk_supplied": "The kindness", "topic": "Articles advanced", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5660, "src": "Miluješ tyhle strmé schody a upřímně, já taky.", "en": "You love these steep steps, and honestly, so do I.", "lk_supplied": "so do I.", "topic": "So, Neither, Nor", "level": "B1", "person": "2sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5661, "src": "Do poledne už vyjde každý jednotlivý schod na hoře, mírně líný den.", "en": "By noon, she will have climbed every single step on the mountain, a mildly lazy day.", "lk_supplied": "will have climbed", "topic": "Future Perfect Simple", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5662, "src": "Tenhle svah je hodně strmý, že?", "en": "This slope is very steep, isn't it?", "lk_supplied": "isn't it?", "topic": "Question tags", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5663, "src": "Do západu slunce sjede celý svah. Očividně jen malá ranní procházka.", "en": "By sunset, he will have skied the whole slope. Obviously just a small morning walk.", "lk_supplied": "will have skied", "topic": "Future Perfect Simple", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
